  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Rainbow aurora light covers Ye Fan’s forearm and right hand, active as if trying to escape. When he pushes his arm forward and shouts for the aurora bird, the light jumps free, turns into a bird, and shoots out as rainbow aurora while anxious bird chirping rises. The rainbow aurora bird lands on heaven attached fungi and destroys the fungi, leaving a tiny pit after the light fades.",
      "chapters": [
        1409
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ye_fan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Against Tie Ruo Nan he activates the mortal killer move Aurora Bird. Rainbow lights gather on his forearms and right palm, chirp, and take the shape of a small sparrow with a powerful aura. At his call the rainbow light leaves his body as a rainbow bird that charges at extreme speed, crashes into her, and turns back into a lump of aurora light that envelops her until her iron mask equipment’s black smoke holds it in deadlock.",
      "chapters": [
        1533
      ],
